{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set confessCandidates = ttm_get_confess_affair_candidates(npc.UUID) %}

{% if confessCandidates != "" %}Eligible partners nearby to confess affair to: {{confessCandidates}}{% endif %}

USE WHEN {{speakingNpc.name}} verbally confesses, admits, or comes clean about their secret romantic or physical affair/infidelity directly to their partner or spouse.
USE ONLY WHEN {{speakingNpc.name}} has explicitly and verbally spoken the confession to their partner in current conversation.
- Specify the victim partner's name and the affair partner's name.
- Provide a brief 1st-person explanation of {{speakingNpc.name}}'s reasons, remorse, guilt, or circumstances.
NEVER use if {{speakingNpc.name}} is merely thinking, suspecting, or talking about someone else's affair.
NEVER use if the partner is not present or if the affair is already publicly known to the partner.
